(4. Discussion) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(The practical implication is unfashionable. Tool vendors sell summarizers and text-to-speech) Tj
0 -13 Td
(so that people can consume papers while remaining interruptible. That may help with) Tj
0 -13 Td
(exposure. It does not obviously help with recall of the parts of a document that are easy to) Tj
0 -13 Td
(lose: numbers, caveats, and who claimed what.) Tj
0 -13 Td
( ) Tj
0 -8 Td
(If an agency needs staff to remember a consultation paper, the cheaper intervention is) Tj
0 -13 Td
(calendar hygiene, not another listening app. A two-host podcast of a document can still be) Tj
0 -13 Td
(useful as a first pass. It should not be confused with encoding the source. We say that as) Tj
0 -13 Td
(researchers who also listen to papers while cooking.) Tj
0 -13 Td
( ) Tj
0 -8 Td
(Civic attention decay is not a metaphor about decadence. It is a measured relationship) Tj
0 -13 Td
(between channel noise and memory for public documents. Cities that email 40-page PDFs into a) Tj
0 -13 Td
(Slack culture should expect the quiz scores we saw.) Tj
0 -13 Td
( ) Tj
0 -8 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F3 13 Tf
(5. Limitations) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(This sample is convenient, not civic in the strict sense: we have more software firms than) Tj
0 -13 Td
(planning departments. The reading task used one document. Two weeks is a short window.) Tj
0 -13 Td
(Firm-level assignment of the quiet hour means we cannot separate the policy from the kind of) Tj
0 -13 Td
(firm willing to try it. We did not observe what people did with the recovered minutes; some) Tj
0 -13 Td
(of them certainly opened another tab.) Tj
0 -13 Td
( ) Tj
0 -8 Td
(We also cannot see notifications that never hit the OS log, such as a colleague waving on a) Tj
0 -13 Td
(video call. Our density measure is a lower bound. If anything, the true association is) Tj
0 -13 Td
(steeper.) Tj
0 -13 Td
( ) Tj
0 -8 Td
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F3 13 Tf
(6. Conclusion) Tj
0 -16 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(We conclude that notification density is a first-order predictor of whether a workplace) Tj
0 -13 Td
(paper is remembered. A quiet hour is a blunt, free intervention that recovered a large share) Tj
0 -13 Td
(of lost recall in this sample. If you are going to assign a document, assign the silence it) Tj
0 -13 Td
(needs.) Tj
0 -13 Td
( ) Tj
0 -8 Td
(Future work should test the same design on actual city staff reading zoning packets, and) Tj
0 -13 Td
(should ask whether audio walkthroughs of a paper help or merely create an illusion of) Tj
0 -13 Td
(coverage. Until then, the sentence we want repeated is this: interruption frequency predicts) Tj
0 -13 Td
(afternoon recall better than hours spent with the file open.) Tj
0 -13 Td
( ) Tj
